# Parses cleanly, carries no asciidoc.attributes mapping. Proves the guard refuses a descriptor
# whose SHAPE is wrong, instead of deriving an empty placeholder set from it — an empty set is
# indistinguishable from "nothing is placeholder-shaped", and both print a green tick.
#
# Named .yml.fixture so no repo-wide YAML linter treats it as a real descriptor.
name: canary-no-attributes
title: "Canary"
version: ~
nav:
  - modules/ROOT/nav.adoc
asciidoc:
  extensions: []
